Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Lets babsonradio.com reach the studio helper on 127.0.0.1 without Chrome asking each time (Local Network Access).
[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Policies\Google\Chrome\LocalNetworkAccessAllowedForUrls]
"1"="https://babsonradio.com"
"2"="https://www.babsonradio.com"
